:::text id=fZX-2Zm-MI at=top-center width=86% height=120 preset=title align=center
# Collaboration Expectations
:::

:::shape id=tkVukHvjH1 at=center width=480 height=424 offsetX=-256 offsetY=80 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=20 shadow=md
:::

:::icon id=sBzC6AEP-r at=center offsetX=-256 offsetY=-80 name=alert-triangle size=48 color=#EF4444
:::

:::text id=eTIsbPPtE5 at=center width=424 height=40 offsetX=-256 offsetY=-16 preset=caption align=center color=text
PET PEEVES
:::

:::text id=XHiNJufIeT at=center width=424 offsetX=-256 offsetY=120 preset=body align=left color=muted
- Unscheduled comms for non-urgent matters
- Refusal of ideas without clear reasons
- Lack of context upfront
- Expecting live call multi-tasking
:::

:::shape id=qiBRkykmgB at=center width=480 height=424 offsetX=264 offsetY=80 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=20 shadow=md
:::

:::icon id=dwh-UVNbq8 at=center offsetX=264 offsetY=-80 name=check-circle size=48 color=#16A34A
:::

:::text id=7MhDHNZGfd at=center width=424 height=40 offsetX=264 offsetY=-16 preset=caption align=center color=text
GOLDEN RULES
:::

:::text id=V56U-Ah1FD at=center width=424 offsetX=264 offsetY=120 preset=body align=left color=muted
- Notify beforehand for sync check-ins
- Give reasons & suggest alternatives for refusals
- Share background & facts first
- Focus on one conversation at a time
:::
